Bitcoin reserve with the ARMA bill\nprimary_keyword: Strategic Bitcoin Reserve\nprimary_asset: Bitcoin\n\n=== /tmp/crypto-run-20260522-071903/research/raw.json ERR Expecting value: line 1 column 1 (char 0)\n=== /tmp/crypto-run-20260522-072258/research/raw.json\nstory_id: us-strategic-bitcoin-reserve-arma-bill-2026-05-22\ntopic_theme: US lawmakers revive strategic Bitcoin reserve push with the ARMA bill\nprimary_headline: US lawmakers renew strategic Bitcoin reserve push with ARMA bill\nprimary_keyword: strategic Bitcoin reserve\nprimary_asset: Bitcoin\n\n=== /tmp/crypto-run-20260522-073952/research/raw.json\n\n=== /tmp/crypto-run-20260522-075225/research/raw.json\nstory_id: ethereum-ef-exodus-new-org-2026-05-22\ntopic_theme: Ethereum Foundation turmoil drives calls for a new $1 billion ETH-aligned organization\nprimary_headline: Prominent Ethereum voices push for a new $1 billion organization as EF departures deepen the network’s identity crisis\nprimary_keyword: Ethereum Foundation\nprimary_asset: Ethereum\n\n=== /tmp/crypto-run-20260522-081534/research/raw.json\nstory_id: strategic-bitcoin-reserve-arma-2026-05-22\ntopic_theme: US Strategic Bitcoin Reserve Legislation\nprimary_headline: US lawmakers introduce ARMA bill to lock a federal Strategic Bitcoin Reserve into law\nprimary_keyword: Bitcoin reserve\nprimary_asset: Bitcoin\n\n=== /tmp/crypto-run-20260522-083045/research/raw.json\nstory_id: us-arma-strategic-bitcoin-reserve-2026-05-22\ntopic_theme: US lawmakers move to codify a strategic Bitcoin reserve through the American Reserve Modernization Act\nprimary_headline: US lawmakers push ARMA bill to lock a strategic Bitcoin reserve into federal law\nprimary_keyword: Strategic Bitcoin reserve\nprimary_asset: Bitcoin\n\n=== /tmp/crypto-run-20260522-093013/research/raw.json\nstory_id: polymarket-japan-approval-2026-05-22\ntopic_theme: Polymarket's push for prediction-market approval in Japan by 2030\nprimary_headline: Polymarket targets Japan approval by 2030 as th